1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Track 2 — social-seeding-v2: Mission Control + AP2 + Multi-agent.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Scene 1 — A brand brief drops into Mission Control. The intake agent is a typed function, not a chat-bot. One paste, structured CampaignDraft.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Scene 2 — AP2 Intent Mandate signed in-app. JSON preview visible, Ed25519 signature visible. Per D27, Intent only.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:29,100
Scene 3 — Approvals page: 40 sourcing matches bulk-approved. Every row carries the agent name, USD cost, and contract version.

5
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:44,100
Scene 4 — Outreach drafts: 12 typed emails from the outreach-agent. Operator edits one sentence, sends via Gmail to the D10 test account.

6
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:55,400
Scene 5 — Reply-agent classifies the incoming reply. A2A-only distribution path — no Marketplace dependency.

7
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:10,400
Scene 6 — Shipping fan-out: ship-agent + customs-agent + tracking-agent run in parallel. Three named functions, one workflow.

8
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:21,600
Scene 7 — Verify-agent confirms delivery and live views. Per-delivered-view pricing per D28.

9
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:29,100
Scene 8 — AP2 Cart Mandate is read-only. Per D27, payment release stays human-gated.

10
00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:36,600
Scene 9 — Approval queue empties. Report-agent emits a typed CampaignReport artifact with auto-generated thumbnails.

11
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:47,900
Scene 10 — Dialogflow CX chatbot answers a follow-up cost-per-view question, citing the per-view metering table.

12
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:57,300
Scene 11 — Cost ledger sweep. 173 agent calls, $1.34 total, well under the $1,500 GCP credit envelope per D39.

13
00:01:57,300 --> 00:02:01,100
Scene 12 — System health check. brand_campaign_smoke.py: 22 agents, 0 failures, $1.34 — PASS.

14
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:55,000
Three angles, one product: agents are functions, the gap is reframed, the multimodal AP2 multi-agent loop runs end-to-end today.

15
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,000
github.com/ComBba/social-seeding-v2 — Apache-2.0 + BUSL-1.1.
